52661-6;LL587-7;CARE_6_c01_Core Functional Status;LA9983-3;1;Independent - Patient completes the activity by themself with no assistance from a helper.;;;
52661-6;LL587-7;CARE_6_c01_Core Functional Status;LA10073-7;2;"Setup or clean-up assistance - Helper sets up or cleans up; patient completes activity. Helper assists only prior to or following the activity.";;;
52661-6;LL587-7;CARE_6_c01_Core Functional Status;LA11757-4;3;Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues or touching/steadying assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently.;;;
52661-6;LL587-7;CARE_6_c01_Core Functional Status;LA10055-4;4;Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort.;;;
52661-6;LL587-7;CARE_6_c01_Core Functional Status;LA10090-1;5;Substantial/maximal assistance – Helper does MORE THAN HALF the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort.;;;
52661-6;LL587-7;CARE_6_c01_Core Functional Status;LA9964-3;6;Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the task.;;;
