95003-0;LL4681-4;CMS_LCDS v4 Functional abilities & goals;LA28225-3;3;Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues and/or touching/steadying and/or contact guard assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently.;;;
95003-0;LL4681-4;CMS_LCDS v4 Functional abilities & goals;LA10055-4;4;Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort.;;;
