83219-6;LL4154-2;CMS IRFPAI_GG Functional Goals;LA11758-2;4;Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports truck or limbs, but provides less than half the effort.;;;
83219-6;LL4154-2;CMS IRFPAI_GG Functional Goals;LA11759-0;5;Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort.;;;
83219-6;LL4154-2;CMS IRFPAI_GG Functional Goals;LA27665-1;6;Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity.;;;
