83222-0;LL4153-4;CMS IRFPAI_GG Functional Abilies;LA11757-4;3;Supervision or touching assistance - Helper provides verbal cues or touching/steadying assistance as patient completes activity. Assistance may be provided throughout the activity or intermittently.;;;
83222-0;LL4153-4;CMS IRFPAI_GG Functional Abilies;LA10055-4;4;Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort.;;;
