83222-0;LL4153-4;CMS IRFPAI_GG Functional Abilies;LA27665-1;6;Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Patient does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the patient to complete the activity.;;;
