83188-3;LL4616-0;CMS_MDS Self Care;LA27996-0;3;Partial/moderate assistance - Helper does less than half the effort. Helper lifts, holds, or supports trunk or limbs, but provides less than half the effort.;;;
83188-3;LL4616-0;CMS_MDS Self Care;LA11759-0;4;Substantial/maximal assistance - Helper does more than half the effort. Helper lifts or holds trunk or limbs and provides more than half the effort.;;;
83188-3;LL4616-0;CMS_MDS Self Care;LA27998-6;5;Dependent - Helper does all of the effort. Resident does none of the effort to complete the activity. Or, the assistance of 2 or more helpers is required for the resident to complete the activity.;;;
