99943-3;LL6209-2;MPSS pain hospitalizations;LA33259-5;2;Two to three pain related hospitalizations;;;
99943-3;LL6209-2;MPSS pain hospitalizations;LA33260-3;3;More than three pain related hospitalizations;;;
